    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      184.17,
      429.89,
      406.17,
      441.23
    ],
    "text": "to amend the Trust Receipts Ordinance (Chapter 86)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      237.55,
      229.79,
      358.98,
      238.65
    ],
    "text": "STATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      252.95,
      452.72,
      297.81
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 4 of the Trust Receipts Ordinance (Chapter 86),and the legal effect of the section as amended is to provide for the legal consequences oftrust receipts registered under the Secured Transactions Act, No. of 2024, but not underthe Registration of Documents Ordinance (Chapter 117).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      312.95,
      452.77,
      369.81
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause makes provisions in regard to the period of enforceability oftrust receipts already registered under the Registration of Documents Ordinance and therequirement of registering those trust receipts under the Secured Transactions Act, No. of2024 upon coming into operation of the said Act in order for them to be further enforceableand for their priority to continue to prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      395.85,
      167.17,
      400.85,
      178.24
    ],
    "text": "1",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      224.01,
      187.81,
      339.46,
      198.88
    ],
    "text": "Trust Receipts (Amendment)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.13,
      207.25,
      222.57,
